# Synthetic consumer fixture for isolated qualification. This pack's
# ctt:composesCommand (rdfs:range cnv:Command) references 4 cnv:* individuals
# from clap-noun-verb-pack's namespace. Found by
# scripts/check_cross_pack_references.py (RC2 lint).
#
# NOTE -- real doc/code drift found while building this fixture, flagged
# here rather than silently papered over: cnv:SessionLogin and
# cnv:UserCreate ARE real, currently-defined individuals in
# packs/clap-noun-verb-pack/ontology.ttl (confirmed by direct read).
# cnv:ReceiptEmit and cnv:AlgorithmList are NOT -- despite this pack's own
# ontology.ttl comments asserting "cnv:ReceiptEmit ... defined with a
# required cnv:args field" (line ~103) and "AlgorithmList ... not a value
# this pack's ontology invented" (line ~68), neither individual exists
# anywhere in clap-noun-verb-pack today. This fixture types all 4 as
# cnv:Command (matching ctt:composesCommand's own declared range) so
# isolated qualification and the new RC2 lint both pass -- it does not
# resolve whether clap-noun-verb-pack is missing two real commands it once
# had, or this pack's comments are stale documentation. That is a separate,
# real question worth its own follow-up, not blocking this fixture.
@prefix cnv: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/clap-noun-verb#> .

cnv:SessionLogin a cnv:Command .
cnv:UserCreate a cnv:Command .
cnv:ReceiptEmit a cnv:Command .
cnv:AlgorithmList a cnv:Command .
